WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.800
Mason, haz que se detengan.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.320
Hey, Mason!

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:06.720
Mason, do you hear me?

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:07.400
How dare you

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.160
sell my family's property?

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:10.240
What are you doing?

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.280
I'm doing what your grandfather

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:13.040
ask about.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.960
I'm fixing the family's affairs.

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.000
Your parents and brother

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.240
left this world,

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.000
leaving the business to us.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:34.160
Let's be honest.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.400
Neither of us is ready

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.160
to carry this burden.

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:39.400
What does that mean?

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:41.400
I mean you have to marry

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:42.400
the youngest Powell.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.200
Powel?

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:49.040
They're murderers.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:50.760
They're responsible

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:52.320
for the deaths of my mom,

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:53.640
dad and brother.

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:56.200
The only thing I like to do

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.240
when I meet Mason

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:59.480
is to claw his eyes out.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Good thing I'm wearing the glasses.
